  "description": "Simple and fast note-taking micro-app with Markdown support",
  "longDescription": "A minimal note-taking app that saves your notes locally. Supports Markdown formatting, multiple notebooks, and search.\n\nFeatures:\n- Markdown support\n- Local persistence\n- Search notes\n- Multiple notebooks",
